1
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,720
YAMU!

2
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:28,457
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,880
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,620
Your moves!

5
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:06,940
This is way too intense.

6
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:09,677
Remember, Tristan, Yugi
beat Kaiba once before.

7
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,517
I'd like to beat Kaiba all right.

8
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,071
What's with Kaiba anyway?

9
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,040
He claims that he's changed,

10
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,757
but he's acting like the same old
creep we used to know and loathe.

11
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,880
I don't get it.

12
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,740
Man, look at these two jokers.

13
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,428
They're really going at it.

14
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,937
Which is fine with me.

15
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:31,844
I got the best seat in the house
for scoping out the competition.

16
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:37,017
Kaiba's trying to finish me off as quickly
as possible, and that's not like him.

17
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:40,937
He enjoys toying with his opponents
almost as much as he enjoys winning.

18
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:45,097
Last time we dueled, he spent half the
match messing with me, but this time,

19
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,480
he's all business.

20
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,497
What's the matter, Yugi?

21
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:50,897
You look a bit worried,

22
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:54,392
finally realizing that without
your precious Exodia cards,

23
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,618
you don't stand a chance against me.

24
00:01:57,180 --> 00:01:59,800
I won't need Exodia to defeat you, Kaiba.

25
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:04,840
If I keep drawing cards
like this, you will.

26
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:08,100
I arm my genie with the D-Spell card.

27
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:13,960
The D-Spell card can
deactivate any magic card.

28
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:18,200
And that's a loss I'm quite sure
you can't afford, Yugi. Watch in!

29
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,106
My mystical genie of the lab!

30
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:21,900
Activate D-Spell!

31
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:23,840
Oh, no!

32
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,200
My cards!

33
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,680
D-spell has destroyed your
swords of revealing light.

34
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,660
That's a tough loss, Yugi.

35
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:46,797
Your swords could have paralyzed
my monsters for three turns,

36
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:49,939
but I guess now you'll just
lose three turns sooner.

37
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,920
Don't count on it, Kaiba!

38
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:56,017
That genie's big trouble, but as
long as he has the lamp to hide,

39
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:57,517
then Yugi can't touch him.

40
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,776
Is there any way to destroy the lamp?

41
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,297
This card might do the trick.

42
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:03,440
The Mystic Box.

43
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:08,197
It could be just the magic card I need
to evict La Jin from his ancient lamp.

44
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:13,440
But first, I call upon the Dark Magician.

45
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,877
I'm surprised you put your
magician at risk, Yugi.

46
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,817
when you have no idea what
I have in store for you.

47
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:28,700
Then perhaps before I attack, I should
see what you're planning for myself. What?

48
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,540
Behold my magic Eye of Truth.

49
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:36,360
So called because the
Eye of Truth knows all,

50
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:39,920
sees all, and it will reveal
every card in your hand.

51
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:44,330
What's this?

52
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:48,337
You've got a blue-eyes white dragon in
your hand, but you haven't played it.

53
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:50,717
You can always count
on Kaiba to have a blue

54
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,937
-eyes white dragon or three up his sneaky,

55
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:53,850
slimy sleeve.

56
00:03:53,933 --> 00:03:55,684
Kaiba sure loves his blue eyes.

57
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:57,585
Three blue-eyes white dragons?

58
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,857
That's got to be nearly
impossible for Yugi to beat.

59
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:04,877
Yeah, well, Yugi's beaten three blue
eyes before, and he'll beat him again.

60
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,340
What's Kaiba up to?

61
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:09,719
Why hasn't he played his
blue-eyes white dragon yet?

62
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,717
Yugi may have glimpsed
the blue eyes in my hand,

63
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,657
but I doubt that even he
could guess what I'm planning,

64
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:17,817
because it's never been done before.

65
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:22,437
I'm going to take all three of my
mighty Blue-Eyes White Dragons and

66
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:26,880
fuse them together into one incredible
creature of unsurpassed power.

67
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,620
The ultimate Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

68
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,920
So, Yu-Gi,

69
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:37,340
the mundane magic of your wimpy Eye of
Truth allowed you a sneak peek at my hand.

70
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,197
But what good does it do you?

71
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:44,620
The fact still remains that your dark
magician can't do anything against my genie,

72
00:04:44,740 --> 00:04:45,570
La Jin.

73
00:04:45,653 --> 00:04:48,957
not while he has his lamp
to protect him then I'll

74
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:52,717
extinguish it through the
magic of my mystic box

75
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,937
now watch closely kaiba
as first my dark magician

76
00:04:57,020 --> 00:05:00,677
is sealed within the box a
trick it's much more than

77
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:03,157
a mere magic trick as
you're about to find out

78
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:07,377
kaiba now watch and be
amazed as the mystic box is

79
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:10,657
skewered but have I destroyed
my own dark magician

80
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:13,740
or have I magically
extinguished your ancient lamp,

81
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,000
just as I promised.

82
00:05:15,340 --> 00:05:17,920
Ugh, no, you've destroyed my genie's lamp.

83
00:05:18,060 --> 00:05:20,360
And the magic's only half done, Kaiba,

84
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:24,720
for my dark magician emerges
from the mystic box unharmed.

85
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,820
But how?

86
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:29,280
You know a good magician
never reveals his secrets.

87
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:32,220
Now, dark magician, dark magic attack!

88
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:36,700
No, my genie!

89
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:40,280
It's just as you said, Kaiba.

90
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:45,360
The ancient lamp may have protected
your great genie, La Jinne.

91
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:49,940
But once it was destroyed, your genie
was no match for my dark magician.

92
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:53,077
Your little magic show may
have been entertaining.

93
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,984
But let's not lose perspective.

94
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,977
You know I've got a blue
eyes waiting in the wings,

95
00:05:58,060 --> 00:06:01,236
and I know you have nothing
that can stand against it.

96
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,260
You know nothing.

97
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:07,346
The Eye of Truth showed me your
hand, not the other way around.

98
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:09,417
I don't need to see your hand.

99
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:12,177
But I think you need
to be taught a lesson,

100
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:15,848
and I'll be happy to make my
next play painfully instructive.

101
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:19,937
This combination of Soggy the
Dark Clown and the Contagious

102
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:23,079
Crush card should help me
infect Yugi's life points.

103
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:30,280
Behold, Soggy the Dark Clown!

104
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,300
Soggy the Dark Clown?

105
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:40,637
I was expecting Kaiba to sick
his Blue-Eyes White Dragon on me.

106
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:43,620
He knows Soggy is no match
for my Dark Magician.

107
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:45,220
What's he up to?

108
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:49,257
He didn't have any trap cards earlier
when I got a look at his hand,

109
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:51,987
but he might have drawn
some new ones by now.

110
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:54,709
The only way to know
for sure is to attack.

111
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,376
But I dare not risk my Dark Magician.

112
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,100
Dark Magician, return!

113
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,940
All right, good card.

114
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,557
Gaia the Fierce Knight.

115
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:09,052
He wiped the floor with Soggy
in my first duel with Kaiba.

116
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:12,360
And he will defeat Soggy once again.

117
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:16,980
Gaia, the Fierce Knight, in attack mode!

118
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,877
Your dark clown has
been vanquished, Kaiba!

119
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:36,640
Vanquished and sacrificed are
two very different things, Yugi.

120
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,560
Look again!

121
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,630
No!

122
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:42,560
What's happening?

123
00:07:43,740 --> 00:07:44,570
Gaia!

124
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:47,280
Not just Gaia, Yugi. No!

125
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,700
My Dark Magician!

126
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,600
What have you done, Kaiba?

127
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:53,075
It's really quite ingenious, actually.

128
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:56,397
Knowing that you couldn't
resist attacking my Dark Clown,

129
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,940
I infected him with the Crush Card Virus.

130
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:00,217
A Crush Card?

131
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:04,860
By destroying the infected Soggy,
you released the Crush Card Virus.

132
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:07,917
A virus that is so
highly contagious to duel

133
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,720
monsters that even as I speak these words,

134
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:15,340
it is infecting all but the weakest
cards in your precious dueling deck.

135
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,560
No! My cards!

136
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:22,397
The only monsters unaffected
by the Crush Card Virus

137
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:25,304
are those with an attack
power weaker than 1500.

138
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:29,100
Looks like I've broken the
heart of your cards, Yugi.

139
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:40,057
That crush card Kaiba used to
infect my deck makes it so I

140
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:43,437
can't use any monsters with
more than 1,500 attack points.

141
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:47,755
Well played, but it will take more
than a virus to win this duel, Kaiba.

142
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:51,440
Yes, I expect that it will, Yugi.

143
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:53,130
Actually,

144
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:57,771
I'm looking forward to subjecting you
to a wide array of debilitating cards.

145
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:01,120
Keep talking the talk, Big Mouth Kaiba.

146
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,917
Just don't forget that
Yugi beat you last time.

147
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,120
Yeah, and now Yugi's an
even better duelist. Yes,

148
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:09,497
but last time he didn't
have a crush card forcing

149
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:12,117
him to play just magic
cards and weak monsters.

150
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,030
You're kidding.

151
00:09:13,113 --> 00:09:16,824
He's only allowed to play magic
cards and his wimpiest creatures?

152
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,360
He'll still win.

153
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:26,297
this is turning out to
be quite the show all i'm

154
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:28,857
really missing is a hot
dog and a bag of popcorn

155
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,797
oh well from the looks
of things this duel isn't

156
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:34,197
gonna last long enough for
me to enjoy them anyway

157
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:37,337
besides getting the lowdown
on these chumps dueling

158
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:40,757
strategies is plenty for
me to snack on your turn

159
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:43,617
yugi let's see how your
disease ridden deck serves

160
00:09:43,700 --> 00:09:47,220
you now you may have
infected the body of my deck,

161
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:52,361
Kaiba, but it is the heart of the cards
that will see me through this contamination.

162
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:54,260
The Summoned Skull.

163
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:58,840
But I can't use him because his
attack points are over 1,500.

164
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:03,177
Kaiba's Crush card would infect him
the second I laid him on the field.

165
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:04,090
Face it, Yugi.

166
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:09,106
To continue playing in this duel, you'll
have to serve up your weakest monsters.

167
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,430
He's right.

168
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:13,400
For now, that's all I can do.

169
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,230
Silverfang!

170
00:10:16,313 --> 00:10:17,143
Defense mode!

171
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:21,317
And his attack points are low enough
to make him immune to your virus.

172
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,230
Your turn.

173
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:26,929
Ironic that a wolf will be the first of
your sacrificial lambs, but so be it.

174
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:30,340
Ah, the second of my three
blue-eyes white dragons.

175
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:35,541
Just one more now, and then absolutely
nothing will be able to keep me from victory.

176
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:40,117
Soon, with one earth-shattering blast,
I'll defeat Yugi for the last time.

177
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,788
And once I've finished him,

178
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,941
I'll go after Pegasus and rescue
my brother from his demented grip.

179
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:50,160
But while I'm waiting
for my third Blue Eyes,

180
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,900
I'll clear the field
of Yugi's rabid beast.

181
00:10:56,500 --> 00:11:00,420
Battle Ox, awaken and let
loose the dogs of war!

182
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:05,700
Axe Slam Attack!

183
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:12,240
Your puppy has been put down.

184
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,460
It's cool!

185
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:17,780
Just a minor setback, no
big deal! Come on, Yugi!

186
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,412
I know you can win this!

187
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:22,973
No one's ever beaten you in
a duel, and no one ever will!

188
00:11:24,260 --> 00:11:28,797
Your pitiful defenses can't even withstand
the crude assaults of my battle ox!

189
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:32,357
How do you expect to protect your life
points when your defenses are demolished

190
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:36,557
and you have nothing left to shield you
against my even more powerful monsters?

191
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,699
I guess we'll find out soon enough!

192
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:40,350
Kaiba's right,

193
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,697
but how can I defeat any
monster when his crush

194
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:45,097
card forces me to play
my weakest creatures?

195
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:47,651
You should accept your fate for now, Yugi.

196
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:51,797
After all, you'll have the rest of your
entire life to brood over this defeat.

197
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:54,000
No, I can't give in to his taunting.

198
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:58,479
I've come here to rescue my grandpa,
and I can't let Kaiba defeat me.

199
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,280
Grifor! Go!

200
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:04,020
I summon you!

201
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:14,360
Let's see you deal with
this attack, Kaiba.

202
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,160
A Grifor.

203
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,320
I think you've made a
grave miscalculation, Yugi.

204
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:24,020
His pathetic defenses are
no match for my battle ox.

205
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:28,957
Whoever said that I was going to be
playing him in defense mode, Kaiba?

206
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,040
What do you mean?

207
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:32,600
I'm attacking with my Grifor.

208
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:35,133
With the help of my Horn of the Unicorn.

209
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:37,660
Magic lightning combo attack!

210
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:44,280
Your battle-ox has been destroyed.

211
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:49,680
All right, I'm feeling
a comeback in the works.

212
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:50,800
Stellar move!

213
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:53,877
Good show, that was a brilliant
play at a critical junction.

214
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,520
Yeah, Yugi, great move!

215
00:12:56,780 --> 00:13:00,977
Impressive, Yugi, using a combo attack
to combat the perils of my virus.

216
00:13:01,060 --> 00:13:05,825
But I'm afraid that there are some hazards
in my deck that are simply inevitable.

217
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:07,937
It's my turn now.

218
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:09,220
At last!

219
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:12,852
Now all I need is a polymerization
card to merge them all!

220
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:16,077
Prepare yourself for
ultimate annihilation, Yugi!

221
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:18,920
But first, I'm invoking the Mystical Elf!

222
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:23,380
You see, Yugi,

223
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:25,897
if there's one thing I've
learned in my matches with you,

224
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:30,077
it's that you have an uncanny ability for
snatching victory from the jaws of defeat.

225
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:33,217
But I don't intend to give
you such an opportunity today.

226
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:38,340
Which is why I've summoned the Mystical
Elf to reinforce my life points by 300.

227
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:42,281
I've never seen Kaiba duel
so methodically before.

228
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:44,880
Every move he plays is so precise.

229
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,857
He's leaving nothing to chance.

230
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:50,293
It's as if, to him, this were
a battle of life and death.

231
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:53,995
Soon, little brother.

232
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,657
Soon I'll have completed
Pegasus's twisted little

233
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:59,858
task and then nothing will
stop me from rescuing you.

234
00:14:00,140 --> 00:14:02,300
Soon, once I defeat Yugi,

235
00:14:03,260 --> 00:14:04,090
behold!

236
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:09,200
The mighty Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

237
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:20,220
Now, Yugi, your fate belongs to me!

238
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:23,400
Take flight, Blue-Eyes White Dragon, rise!

239
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:29,660
Go, White Lightning Attack!

240
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:35,050
Ah!

241
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,560
Already my blue eyes has you cowering.

242
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:54,524
And this is only the beginning.

243
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:57,300
Soon, you will know what fear is.

244
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:01,320
I don't fear your blue eyes, Kaiba.

245
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:02,657
I've defeated him before.

246
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:07,446
And with my giant soldier of stone guarding
me, I'll manage to defeat him again.

247
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,700
I'm afraid you're mistaken.

248
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:16,860
Yugi, when you battled my blue eyes
before, they were three separate dragons.

249
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:19,400
Formidable, yes, but not invincible.

250
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:24,480
But now I've found a way
to merge their power,

251
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:27,060
combine their attack points to create...

252
00:15:29,260 --> 00:15:32,000
A monster with power beyond imagining!

253
00:15:32,980 --> 00:15:35,840
Now I create a dual monster without peer,

254
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:40,220
with attack force so great that
no monster can stand against him.

255
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:52,680
I create the Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.

256
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:56,157
So that's why he didn't
play his Blue Eyes at first.

257
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,037
He was waiting to merge them all together.

258
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:02,500
Yu-Gi-Modo, there's no escape!

259
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:04,960
Nothing can save you now!

260
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:10,577
That monster's attack
points are all the charts!

261
00:16:10,660 --> 00:16:13,297
Yeah, how could any creature in
Yu-Gi's deck beat that thing?

262
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:14,280
That Kaiba!

263
00:16:14,620 --> 00:16:18,180
He's been setting Yu-Gi up for
that beast this entire time!

264
00:16:22,980 --> 00:16:24,620
Yu-Gi is done for.

265
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,937
Kaiba had that little twerp on the ropes,

266
00:16:27,020 --> 00:16:30,297
and now this ultimate blue eyes is
gonna knock him out of the ring.

267
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:31,780
This can't be the end.

268
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:33,697
It just can't. Yu-Gi-Oh!

269
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:35,900
find a way to come back. I know it.

270
00:16:36,340 --> 00:16:38,797
Kaiba has really played
a brilliant strategy.

271
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:40,577
Setting me up with that crush card,

272
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:42,477
holding out for all
three of his blue eyes,

273
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:46,520
and at the same time whittling down
my life points to a sparse 400.

274
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:51,747
Now he's got me cornered and staring down
the toughest monster I've ever faced.

275
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:54,820
Yugi, how I savor this moment.

276
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:57,137
This is the moment I've been waiting for,

277
00:16:57,220 --> 00:17:00,937
ever since you handed me my first
and only Duel Monster's defeat.

278
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:04,491
Prepare yourself to see the
power of my creature unleashed.

279
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:07,900
Blue-Eyes Ultimate White Dragon!

280
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,760
Neutron Blast Attack!

281
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:13,390
No!

282
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:14,740
My Stone Soldier!

283
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:19,840
You're lucky your Stone Soldier
was in defense mode. Whoa.

284
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:22,791
At least Yugi didn't lose any life points.

285
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:25,277
Stone Soldier was the last of my defenses.

286
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:29,242
My Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon
atomized your creature to dust, Yugi.

287
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,617
You know you have nothing
to stand against it.

288
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:32,880
You should concede.

289
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:36,320
No, Yugi.

290
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:38,460
You can win this. That's right.

291
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,180
We all believe in you.

292
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:42,177
You gotta remember what
you're fighting for, Yugi.

293
00:17:42,260 --> 00:17:44,537
The heart of the cards, just
like your grandpa taught you.

294
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:46,677
You've never let anyone down before,

295
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:49,878
and I know you're not gonna
let your grandpa down now

296
00:17:56,860 --> 00:17:58,617
Grandpa, I won't let you down.

297
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:00,524
I have to keep fighting for you

298
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:07,720
No Kaiba, I will never
surrender to the likes of you.

299
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:10,429
That's it That's the
kind of determination.

300
00:18:10,660 --> 00:18:12,420
I expect from you fight on

301
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:15,337
Gather every last bit
of your strength, Yugi.

302
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:18,217
I prefer to take you down when
you're fighting your hardest.

303
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:19,937
Everything rides on this last card.

304
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:22,314
This duel, this tournament, my grandpa.

305
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:26,200
But as hopeless as it seems,
I still have to believe.

306
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:27,620
Good luck, Yugi.

307
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,600
You can do it, pal. Believe.

308
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,680
Kick butt, Yugi!

309
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:38,620
It comes to this.

310
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,957
So draw your card and face your fate.

311
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,800
Heart of the cards.

312
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:44,240
Guide me.

313
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:46,340
Let's finish this, Kaiba.
